    "detailed_description": "AudioTheory Guitars is the ultimate reference tool for guitar notes and chords. Featuring a built-in keyboard, each note reacts to your input across the customisable chord and fretboard diagrams. For anyone who's ever wished music theory was that little bit more straightforward \u2013 this is the software for you. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176110/extras/81fb2187a305ccc4881692be42388dd5.poster.avif?t=1741170680\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176110/extras/81fb2187a305ccc4881692be42388dd5.webp?t=1741170680\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The full set of features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Seamlessly transcribe</strong> between piano and guitar using a straight-forward colour coding system and notation highlighting. Play a note on the keyboard, or directly from the chord and fretboard diagrams to see where it is across all formats.<br><br></li><li><strong>Set your tuning and capo</strong>. Everything else adjusts accordingly \u2013 no need for a chord transposition chart.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176110/extras/6e49ebb96fddafd3202b11aaae590a40.poster.avif?t=1741170680\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176110/extras/6e49ebb96fddafd3202b11aaae590a40.webm?t=1741170680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176110/extras/6e49ebb96fddafd3202b11aaae590a40.mp4?t=1741170680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Choose your chords</strong> with open, power, barre, sus2 and dim7 chord sheets with fullscreen diagrams and playback options.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176110/extras/df214b9c3a866828d65304970b576399.poster.avif?t=1741170680\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176110/extras/df214b9c3a866828d65304970b576399.mp4?t=1741170680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Exclude notes</strong> and never play out of key again. Your fretboard diagram now only shows the notes you need and your keyboard doesn't play the ones you don't.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176110/extras/842946c2777ee6ac2f7c382588282ab3.poster.avif?t=1741170680\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176110/extras/842946c2777ee6ac2f7c382588282ab3.webm?t=1741170680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176110/extras/842946c2777ee6ac2f7c382588282ab3.mp4?t=1741170680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Scale presets</strong> you can quickly apply to the application. Save and load functions to easily swap between customised views.<br><br></li><li><strong>MIDI support.</strong> Connect an external MIDI input device to control the on-screen keyboard.<br><br></li><li><strong>Full customisation.</strong> Select the chords you want. Left-handed mode for left-handed players. Set your fretboard size, number of strings, start fret and per-string tuning. </li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "AudioTheory Guitars is the ultimate reference tool for guitar notes and chords. Featuring a built-in keyboard, each note reacts to your input across the customisable chord and fretboard diagrams. For anyone who's ever wished music theory was that little bit more straightforward \u2013 this is the software for you. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176110/extras/81fb2187a305ccc4881692be42388dd5.poster.avif?t=1741170680\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176110/extras/81fb2187a305ccc4881692be42388dd5.webp?t=1741170680\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The full set of features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Seamlessly transcribe</strong> between piano and guitar using a straight-forward colour coding system and notation highlighting. Play a note on the keyboard, or directly from the chord and fretboard diagrams to see where it is across all formats.<br><br></li><li><strong>Set your tuning and capo</strong>. Everything else adjusts accordingly \u2013 no need for a chord transposition chart.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176110/extras/6e49ebb96fddafd3202b11aaae590a40.poster.avif?t=1741170680\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176110/extras/6e49ebb96fddafd3202b11aaae590a40.webm?t=1741170680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176110/extras/6e49ebb96fddafd3202b11aaae590a40.mp4?t=1741170680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Choose your chords</strong> with open, power, barre, sus2 and dim7 chord sheets with fullscreen diagrams and playback options.<br>